{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/25b84e14560b35222d14b426e0748886.avif?t=1761329755\" width=1024 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare your mower and blower, and get ready to head to the heartland of mowing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 is heading to the U.S.A. to start a whole new career in the world of lawncare!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/815fd547e7e18981b81079522b03eaed.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2</strong> (aka <strong>LMS2</strong>) is the sequel to Lawn Mowing Simulator, which builds on the zen-like working-sim feel of the original. Listening to community feedback, and internal reflections, <strong>LMS2</strong> will offer an expanded take on professional lawn care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a <strong>brand new setting</strong> with all new contracts, which will be built with a new grass tech to allow players to get the best cut ever. New mowers and string trimmers will be included, as well as the much requested <strong>leaf blowers</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career mode gets a total overhaul for all you management fans with an explorable HQ from which to run your business, as well as enhanced character customisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are excited to confirm that <strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2</strong> will be releasing on <strong>Steam</strong>, followed by P<strong>layStation 5 and Xbox Series X | S in 2026</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/fe819e0f85b00f68454d6641374a368a.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LMS2</strong> will feature a new <strong>U.S.A setting</strong>, with brand new location designs for players to play in. From suburban lawns to commercial and municipal locations, the game will feature contracts set in all manner of locations of varying sizes and themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/fc42f3b65e6a6e2711930cdcd0e837e5.avif?t=1761329755\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the addition of new equipment means that there will be more to do in every location than just cutting the grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/38f45d236ca2a7d3473c570043f114ef.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know these have been wanted for a long time, and in <strong>LMS2</strong> we plan to have <strong>Leaf Blowers</strong> as a part of the core game for clearing up leaves, as well as grass clippings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Leaf Blowers wouldn\u2019t be much fun without a lot of leaves to blast! So in <strong>LMS2</strong> we plan on having a system where tens of thousands of leaves can be blown around at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t only have a leaf blower to get the job done! <strong>LMS2</strong> will also give the player a trusty <strong>rake</strong> to help get leaves out of those hard to get places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/4aa0d30a342c4469b66ea381690e4b92.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new line up of mowers and string trimmers will be available in <strong>LMS2</strong>, as well as the new addition of leaf blowers, with each one being meticulously recreated in game to be as accurate as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/317eb458d34a63ba0b87495e4e241dff.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/317eb458d34a63ba0b87495e4e241dff.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/317eb458d34a63ba0b87495e4e241dff.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are thrilled to announce that <strong>Scag\u00ae</strong> have signed up to return to <strong>LMS2</strong> with 3 mowers, and we will be announcing another <strong>HUGE</strong> new manufacturer for the franchise soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are also actively in talks with several frequently requested manufacturers from our community's suggestions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/37e9d829cd15bbe75b24c1ba871ed764.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on our socials for the latest manufacturer news!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/3e882ba1cf65c2a9ac9034533d17a76a.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are investing a lot of development time to build a <strong>new grass system</strong> from scratch, that will allow for the Lawns in <strong>LMS2</strong> to be more beautifully rendered and offer much more variety in looks and how the player interacts with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/42504afd5ba88d997574b4855c5ecc84.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flowers</strong> and <strong>weeds</strong> will now become a part of the lawn's make up, as well as much more variation in the uncut lawn, which will really highlight your efforts as a player to make an overgrown lawn look perfect.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831210?t=1761329755","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831210?t=1761329755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/4475334d6810dbd21145a9c58e5f71ea1f36da3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761329755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/4475334d6810dbd21145a9c58e5f71ea1f36da3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761329755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/25b84e14560b35222d14b426e0748886.avif?t=1761329755\" width=1024 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare your mower and blower, and get ready to head to the heartland of mowing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 is heading to the U.S.A. to start a whole new career in the world of lawncare!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/815fd547e7e18981b81079522b03eaed.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2</strong> (aka <strong>LMS2</strong>) is the sequel to Lawn Mowing Simulator, which builds on the zen-like working-sim feel of the original. Listening to community feedback, and internal reflections, <strong>LMS2</strong> will offer an expanded take on professional lawn care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ec6eb649ebbc3435dae1ae8437deb0db.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a <strong>brand new setting</strong> with all new contracts, which will be built with a new grass tech to allow players to get the best cut ever. New mowers and string trimmers will be included, as well as the much requested <strong>leaf blowers</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f05886306ad58bfd376b08896cac8a65.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career mode gets a total overhaul for all you management fans with an explorable HQ from which to run your business, as well as enhanced character customisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/0872f0b1b9c84ad3713f98185c808c86.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are excited to confirm that <strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2</strong> will be releasing on <strong>Steam</strong>, followed by P<strong>layStation 5 and Xbox Series X | S in 2026</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/fe819e0f85b00f68454d6641374a368a.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LMS2</strong> will feature a new <strong>U.S.A setting</strong>, with brand new location designs for players to play in. From suburban lawns to commercial and municipal locations, the game will feature contracts set in all manner of locations of varying sizes and themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/fc42f3b65e6a6e2711930cdcd0e837e5.avif?t=1761329755\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the addition of new equipment means that there will be more to do in every location than just cutting the grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/38f45d236ca2a7d3473c570043f114ef.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know these have been wanted for a long time, and in <strong>LMS2</strong> we plan to have <strong>Leaf Blowers</strong> as a part of the core game for clearing up leaves, as well as grass clippings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/9fec6a22798c219d851f15a2c8eefee6.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Leaf Blowers wouldn\u2019t be much fun without a lot of leaves to blast! So in <strong>LMS2</strong> we plan on having a system where tens of thousands of leaves can be blown around at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a44469cf748aae221a89cf63027933fa.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t only have a leaf blower to get the job done! <strong>LMS2</strong> will also give the player a trusty <strong>rake</strong> to help get leaves out of those hard to get places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/4aa0d30a342c4469b66ea381690e4b92.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new line up of mowers and string trimmers will be available in <strong>LMS2</strong>, as well as the new addition of leaf blowers, with each one being meticulously recreated in game to be as accurate as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/317eb458d34a63ba0b87495e4e241dff.poster.avif?t=1761329755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/317eb458d34a63ba0b87495e4e241dff.webm?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/317eb458d34a63ba0b87495e4e241dff.mp4?t=1761329755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are thrilled to announce that <strong>Scag\u00ae</strong> have signed up to return to <strong>LMS2</strong> with 3 mowers, and we will be announcing another <strong>HUGE</strong> new manufacturer for the franchise soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are also actively in talks with several frequently requested manufacturers from our community's suggestions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/37e9d829cd15bbe75b24c1ba871ed764.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on our socials for the latest manufacturer news!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/3e882ba1cf65c2a9ac9034533d17a76a.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are investing a lot of development time to build a <strong>new grass system</strong> from scratch, that will allow for the Lawns in <strong>LMS2</strong> to be more beautifully rendered and offer much more variety in looks and how the player interacts with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/42504afd5ba88d997574b4855c5ecc84.avif?t=1761329755\" width=700 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flowers</strong> and <strong>weeds</strong> will now become a part of the lawn's make up, as well as much more variation in the uncut lawn, which will really highlight your efforts as a player to make an overgrown lawn look perfect.</p>","developers":["Skyhook Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/7894efb2f692857c4191bc979c18468207885ee0/header.jpg?t=1761329755","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Lawn Mowing Simulator \u00a9 Skyhook Games Ltd. The intellectual property rights, including trademarks and copyright for the lawn mowers and brands featured in the game, belong to their respective owners.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Lawn Mowing Simulator 2","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400, AMD Ryzen 5 1400, or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050Ti, AMD Radeon RX 470 graphics card or better (min 3GB VRAM, DX12 support)<br></li><